{"name":"Wedding Flowers","hex":"#bcb6cb","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wedding","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A marriage ceremony; a ritual officially celebrating the beginning of a marriage.","The joining of two or more parts."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of wed"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wedding"},{"term":"flowers","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of flower"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of flower"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/flowers"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wedding","blocks":[{"text":"A wedding is a ceremony in which two people are united in marriage. Wedding traditions and customs vary greatly between cultures, ethnicities, races, religions, denominations, countries, social classes, and sexual orientations. Most wedding ceremonies involve an exchange of marriage vows by a couple; a presentation of a gift ; and a public proclamation of marriage by an authority figure or celebrant. Special wedding garments are often worn, and the ceremony is sometimes followed by a wedding reception. Music, poetry, prayers, or readings from religious texts or literature are also commonly incorporated into the ceremony, as well as superstitious customs."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Hindu_wedding_rituals_b_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Hindu_wedding_rituals_b_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wedding"},{"title":"Flower","blocks":[{"text":"Flowers, also known as blossoms and blooms, are the reproductive structures of flowering plants. Typically, they are structured in four circular levels around the end of a stalk. These include: sepals, which are modified leaves that support the flower; petals, often designed to attract pollinators; male stamens, where pollen is presented; and female gynoecia, where pollen is received and its movement is facilitated to the egg. When flowers are arranged in a group, they are known collectively as an inflorescence."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Magnolia_grandiflora_-_flower_1.jpg/330px-Magnolia_grandiflora_-_flower_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flower"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/C%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie_jeloua.jpg/500px-C%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie_jeloua.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/C%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie_jeloua.jpg/500px-C%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie_jeloua.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AC%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie_jeloua.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG/500px-9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG/1280px-9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG/500px-9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A9612jfWedding_ceremonies_in_the_Philippines_12.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Armenian_Wedding_at_Khor_Virap_%281%29.jpg/500px-Armenian_Wedding_at_Khor_Virap_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parse